		{
			dependencies: [
				"281C7940CD437B69"
				"5F109188BE4D9767"
			]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"The Moon is a barren, lifeless rock… why did you want to come here?"
				""
				"The most immediate benefit is that the Moon is a great source of &9Deuterium&r. This substance will be necessary for producing &9Microversium&r, &9Tritium&r, plasmas from fusion, and crystallizing &6Dilithium&r."
				""
				"To obtain this, the Moon has fluid deposits of &eDeuterium&r and &eHelium-3&r, which you can harvest with a &3Fluid Rig&r. However, you will want to use the second Fluid Rig tier to extract it, as the amount of Deuterium and Helium-3 is too low to be anything appreciable from a first tier Fluid Rig."
				""
				"The second draw is &6Moon Sand&r and &6Moon Stone&r, which make up the surface of the Moon. These can be ground up into &6Moon Dust&r which can serve as another means of obtaining &9Deuterium&r, or else be made into &6Quantum Flux&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The third reason to visit the moon are the several ores that are rare on the Overworld but exist in abundance on the Moon. In particular, the Moon contains large quantities of &6Titanium&r, (in the form of &6Aluminium Ore&r and &6Ilmenite Ore&r) &6Chromium&r, (in the form of &6Chromite Ore&r) and &6Fluorine&r. (in the form of &6Fluorite Ore&r)"
				""
				"Please note that space exploration isn't mandatory in this pack, so if you don't feel like exploring space with &bAd Astra&r then you can obtain these through other means, for example centrifuging &9Hydrogen&r or &9Ender Air&r for &eDeuterium&r instead."
				""
				"Just keep in mind that it's much less materially rewarding to forgo exploration."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:deuterium_bucket"
			id: "7DE2C9292A09FC76"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7D1DF49C64A72FE6"
				item: "kubejs:moni_nickel"
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "585B4986E1D33DF9"
					item: "gtceu:deuterium_bucket"
					optional_task: true
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "38A5BF7FD03E9DE3"
					item: "kubejs:moon_dust"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&2Lunar Resources"
			x: 3.5d
			y: -4.0d
		}
