		{
			dependencies: ["193B7038EAB6EFA3"]
			description: [
				"The &3Oxygen Loader&r is used to load &9Oxygen&r into your Space Suit, making it usable for exploring the great beyond. It will need power to do so. You may alternatively use a &3Canner&r."
				""
