		{
			dependencies: ["281C7940CD437B69"]
			description: [
				"If you wish to create an off-Earth base or otherwise conduct operations longer than a mining trip, &3Ad Astra&r offers a few machines that will be helpful or even necessary to your objective."
				""
				"1. The &3Oxygen Distributor&r. When supplied with power and &9Oxygen&r, this machine creates a breathable volume of air around it which expands to fit the environment it's contained in up to six thousand (6000) blocks in volume. It also prevents &9Water&r in this area from freezing, and is therefore necessary for the operation of a &3Rock Crusher&r."
				""
				"2. The &3Oxygen Sensor&r. This block emits a redstone signal and displays a green light when it's in an oxygenated environment. Check one before you take your helmet off to ensure you don't suffocate!"
				""
				"3. The &3Gravity Normalizer&r. This machine unlocks in &5EV&r, and when supplied with power it allows you to control gravity nearby similar to the Oxygen Distributor. If the low gravity on &bThe Moon&r or in &bOrbit&r bothers you, then give it a whirl!"
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:space_painting"
